{"mode":"words","text":"Nuo čia viską lemia tavo mokymosi tikslas. Jei nori tik suprasti kalbą, tavo tikslas jau pasiektas – tiesiog lik prie antrojo ir trečiojo žingsnių. Jei nori kalbėti, laikas choro kartojimui: pasinaudodamas A-B kartojimu, pasirink trumpą sakinį, nustatyk labai lėtą greitį ir kartok kartu su įrašu – kaip chore. Tu iš karto išgirsi, jei kažkas skamba kitaip, ir pats save ištaisysi. Tai galima daryti bet kur, net tramvaje: su ausinėmis tai skamba kaip pokalbis telefonu. O jei nori išmokti rašyti, tiesiog perrašyk tekstą sakinys po sakinio.","words":[{"s":0,"e":160},{"s":240,"e":400},{"s":440,"e":720},{"s":780,"e":1120},{"s":1160,"e":1360},{"s":1400,"e":2000},{"s":2040,"e":2640},{"s":2960,"e":3680},{"s":3720,"e":3920},{"s":3960,"e":4080},{"s":4140,"e":4640},{"s":4680,"e":5280},{"s":5400,"e":5680},{"s":5720,"e":6080},{"s":6120,"e":6240},{"s":6300,"e":6880},{"s":7120,"e":7360},{"s":7408,"e":7760},{"s":7800,"e":7920},{"s":7960,"e":8160},{"s":8220,"e":8560},{"s":8613,"e":8720},{"s":8780,"e":9200},{"s":9240,"e":9840},{"s":10213,"e":11080},{"s":11110,"e":11320},{"s":11350,"e":11920},{"s":12187,"e":12960},{"s":12987,"e":13200},{"s":13248,"e":14960},{"s":15000,"e":15840},{"s":15920,"e":16320},{"s":16384,"e":17120},{"s":17260,"e":17920},{"s":17973,"e":18320},{"s":18400,"e":19360},{"s":19400,"e":19920},{"s":19960,"e":20240},{"s":20280,"e":20560},{"s":20620,"e":21520},{"s":21600,"e":21760},{"s":21824,"e":22160},{"s":22208,"e":22480},{"s":22560,"e":22720},{"s":22880,"e":23280},{"s":23440,"e":23600},{"s":23627,"e":23760},{"s":23827,"e":24240},{"s":24587,"e":25280},{"s":25320,"e":25440},{"s":25480,"e":25760},{"s":25800,"e":26280},{"s":26293,"e":26400},{"s":26427,"e":26720},{"s":26747,"e":27120},{"s":27184,"e":27680},{"s":27813,"e":28080},{"s":28160,"e":28320},{"s":28368,"e":28560},{"s":28600,"e":29960},{"s":30090,"e":30480},{"s":30520,"e":30800},{"s":30840,"e":31120},{"s":31180,"e":31360},{"s":31420,"e":31720},{"s":31750,"e":31840},{"s":31872,"e":32480},{"s":32